# Mouse on the ability wheel: the keyboard + mouse player (standing still,
# two bots) is eliminated, opens the wheel (W), then hovers the rows
# (HoverCircle: the hovered row becomes the selection).
# bopl-port --headless --drive scripts/dev/m9-wheel-hover.drive --screenshot scratch/m9/wheel/h.png --size 1280x720
60 press km accept
0 wait charsel
30 press km accept
15 press pad0 accept
15 press pad1 accept
20 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km accept
8 press pad0 start
8 press pad1 start
20 press km accept
0 wait match
0 bot pad0
0 bot pad1
0 wait wheel 0
8 key W
30 shot 01-wheel-open
5 point 1215 543
20 shot 02-hover-a
5 point 1215 588
20 shot 03-hover-b
5 point 1215 500
20 shot 04-hover-c
5 quit
